sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Part as Active verified PART
    participant UI as Composer and message attachments
    participant API as Chat routes
    participant Service as Attachment service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (0068 functions)
    participant Store as Private Supabase Storage

    Note over Part,Store: Upload
    Part->>UI: Choose a file (client pre-check of type and size)
    UI->>API: POST …/attachments, multipart with one file part
    API->>API: Auth chain, attachments usable, send guard
    API->>Service: Pre-check 20 uploads per hour and 100 MB quota
    API->>API: Stream the part and stop above 10 MB
    Service->>Service: Sanitize name, detect type from bytes, extension must match
    Service->>DB: reserve_chat_attachment_upload (per-participant lock)
    DB-->>Service: Row 'uploading', scan_status not_scanned (or limit outcome)
    Service->>Store: Put bytes under a new opaque UUID key
    Service->>DB: Mark row 'pending'
    Service-->>UI: 201 id, filename, type, size, scanStatus
    UI-->>Part: Staged file labelled "Not scanned for malware"

    Note over Part,Store: Send with the message
    Part->>UI: Send nonblank text with up to 5 staged files
    UI->>API: POST …/messages with body and attachmentIds
    API->>DB: send_chat_message_with_attachments or the DM variant
    DB->>DB: One transaction: insert message, link own pending uploads
    DB-->>API: Message row, or the whole send fails
    API-->>UI: 201 message with attachment metadata, never a URL

    Note over Part,Store: Preview or download
    Part->>UI: Preview an image or download a file
    UI->>API: GET …/attachments/:id/access (read guard)
    API->>Service: Attached, in this conversation, downloadable?
    Service-->>UI: Link with a 60-second signed token
    UI->>API: GET /api/chat/attachments/content?token=…
    API->>Service: Verify signature and expiry, recheck read access
    Service->>Store: Get bytes by storage key
    Service-->>UI: Bytes, nosniff, inline image or attachment PDF and text
    UI-->>Part: Show the preview or save the file, then revoke the local URL

    alt Storage or database step fails during upload
        Service->>DB: Delete the reservation (its object is queued for removal)
        Service-->>UI: 503, text draft and other staged files kept
    end
